type: software
title: "chameleon_n1_planar_solutions"
abstract: >-
  Python package implementing exact analytic solutions for the n=1
  chameleon field in planar systems consisting of an arbitrary number of
  uniform-density layers, together with the data used to produce the
  figures in the accompanying paper.
